{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core Gameplay Mechanics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration:</strong> Navigate through claustrophobic tunnels and experiment rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stealth and Survival:</strong> Avoid monstrous creatures and manage limited resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lore Discovery:</strong> Collect a few notes per map to unravel the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Cat and Mouse Gameplay:</strong></u> Enemies actively pursue and capture the player, using various paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Evolving Threat System:</strong></u> The enemy analyzes the player's behavior and learns from their movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Shadow Strategy:</strong></u> The player must use the environment and deception to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Be Smarter and Don't Get Caught.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481270/extras/image.png?t=1745110585\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric Environment:</strong> Flickering lights, eerie soundscapes, and oppressive darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Threats:</strong> Monsters with unique behaviors stalk the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Storytelling:</strong> Story revealed through environmental clues and collectible notes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endgame Encounter:</strong> A dramatic showdown with the ultimate experiment deep within the shafts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481270/extras/HighresScreenshot000